<!--/Post: 9196-->
<!--Post: 9213--><!--Time: 1109433406-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9213"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->George, I have noticed since the arrest yesterday that endless bickering, sarcasm, and rudeness is blanketing this web site.  Is it because people are mad they didn&#39;t solve the crime?  If you don&#39;t like what Lostdog has to say stay off his/her thread! <BR> <BR>Lostdog, don&#39;t stop posting yet.  A lot has to be brought to light still.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9213-->
<!--Post: 9230--><!--Time: 1109439057-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9230"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 9:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yeah, George, lighten up. You&#39;re making a huge embarassment of yourself. Get back on the &#39;medication&#39;!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9230-->
<!--Post: 9233--><!--Time: 1109440505-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9233"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 9:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My question is why no one on Park City, where half the citizenry considered him crazy and creepy, put two and two together and said something if not 20 years ago, at least when Maureen Hedge was killed down the street?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9233-->
<!--Post: 9235--><!--Time: 1109440931-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9235"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 10:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No prob, Victor. God knows you&#39;ve never blown up before. So, still think BTK is the Zodiac?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9235-->
<!--Post: 9238--><!--Time: 1109442048-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9238"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 10:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lmuncy: I never even had a theory. I was personally attacked by this person, as were people I respect. It was out of my system hours ago.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9238-->
<!--Post: 9285--><!--Time: 1109462265-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9285"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 3:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My data dump - I have to admit that this guy bears some extremely eerie technical resemblances to at least one of my POIs, but Rader was definitely NOT on my list.    Very glad now that I didn&#39;t share any of them.  But I&#39;ll say this much, Rader looks da&#42;n good for it in retrospect.  I&#39;m curious if he was on anybody&#39;s POI list.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9285-->
<!--Post: 9312--><!--Time: 1109468209-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9312"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think that claim people thought he was creepy and crazy is sour grapes from people who didn&#39;t like him anyway..Certainly no body thought he was BTK any more than the people in that area thought any city/county official or law enforcement guy who was hard to deal with was a serial killer..being a bore doesn&#39;t make a person a killer...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9312-->
<!--Post: 9332--><!--Time: 1109479258-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9332"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 8:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There was some buzzing after the Park City drop and I&#39;d bet LE put a quiet spotlight on the area, but as to Rader specifically he was a POI to LE only near the end. Without DNA, would he have been apprehended? That&#39;s a scary thought. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9332-->
<!--Post: 9376--><!--Time: 1109486230-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9376"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 10:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It seems without the assistance of Rader&#39;s daughter, the Wichita Police Department would not have apprehended the BTK Strangler.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9376-->
<!--Post: 9418--><!--Time: 1109511962-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9418"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 5:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wonder if LE had surveillance on the missing package #10 we were so worried about. They could have acted like they didnt find it, then just watched. Theres no way he could have let that go. <BR>I thought of this a couple weeks ago, but didnt dare post it, in case it were true. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9418-->
<!--Post: 9423--><!--Time: 1109517437-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9423"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Haytrader<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Haytrader<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 7:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Itty, <BR> <BR>I heard that the security camera at Home Depot caught him doing a drop. Maybe this is the same thing you mentioned since we never were informed of a drop there.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
